1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
靠广告赚钱的Meta
Meta, which makes money from ads,

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:05,080
开始让AI替人挑选商家了
now lets AI choose businesses for people.

3
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,900
那么以后顾客都是先问AI
So, customers will ask AI first.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:11,480
那么你的生意还能不能被找得到
Then, will your business still be found?

5
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,700
咱们本地老板除了把店拍得好看以外
Local business owners, besides making your shop look good,

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,040
也得让人得查得到
you also need to let people find it.

7
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,580
你能提供什么服务什么条件能接
What services can you provide, and on what terms?

8
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,260
预约从哪里进
Where can they make a booking?

9
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:24,860
AI帮顾客挑选的时候都需要这些条件
AI needs these conditions when choosing for customers.

10
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,260
Meta就是Facebook背后的这个公司
Meta is the company behind Facebook.

11
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:31,360
它有社交平台他有庞大的这个广告生意
It has social platforms and a large advertising business.

12
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,620
今年二季度呢收入差不多98%呢
In the second quarter this year, nearly 98% of revenue

13
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,680
是来自于这个广告
came from advertising.

14
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:38,260
他的平均这个上线人数大概在30多亿人
Its average number of online users is over three billion.

15
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:41,420
那么他现在推出这个个人AI助理Muse
It has now introduced the personal AI assistant Muse.

16
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:46,240
这一步就是想把顾客有需求以后的事接进来
This step aims to take over what follows a customer’s need.

17
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:49,260
以前呢就是你刷到广告啊就是自己去挑
Before, you saw an ad and chose for yourself.

18
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:54,180
以后呢你可以直接交代你需要什么你帮我去找
Now, you can tell it: “This is what I need. Find it for me.”

19
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:58,940
最近大家都说这个PA啊其实就是个人的AI助理
The PA people talk about is a personal AI assistant.

20
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:01,120
Muse有自己的云端浏览器
Muse has its own cloud browser.

21
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:03,200
能查资料操作网站填表
It can look things up, operate websites, and fill in forms.

22
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,160
买东西之前让客户去确认
Before buying, it asks the customer to confirm.

23
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:08,160
那这会怎样影响到咱们的生意
How will this affect our businesses?

24
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,460
拿这个兰州订房取个例子
Take booking a room in Lanzhou as an example.

25
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:14,200
假如说你周末带着家人过来开两间房
Suppose your family comes for the weekend and books two rooms.

26
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,100
开着车晚上十点才能到
You are driving and will not arrive until ten at night.

27
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:19,860
那么你把这些要求告诉了AI助理然后再加一句话
You tell the AI assistant your needs and add one thing:

28
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:25,340
行程还不确定取消怎么收费也帮我看清楚
“My plans are uncertain. Check the cancellation charges too.”

29
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:28,820
以前只搜兰州酒店会出来很多的这些选择
Searching “Lanzhou hotels” used to bring up many choices.

30
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:32,640
可现在呢你把这些条件放进去之后有些就不适合
Now, once these conditions are added, some are unsuitable.

31
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:37,400
那么助理要做的就是帮你把这些差别找出来之后
The assistant’s job is to find those differences for you,

32
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:40,060
让你不会一家一家的去问一遍
so you do not have to ask every hotel one by one.

33
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:44,160
如果你允许啊他记住你上次交代过的这些偏好
If you allow it to remember your previous preferences,

34
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:47,400
比如说带老人出门希望有电梯少走路
such as needing a lift and less walking with an older person,

35
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:51,820
下次呢还可以把这些条件一起进行考虑
next time, it can consider those conditions together.

36
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:55,820
日期人数预算变了这些他都会跟你再去确认
If dates, numbers, or budget change, it confirms them again.

37
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:58,520
同样是订房他了解的情况越具体
For the same room booking, the more specific the information,

38
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:02,140
才越有可能帮你挑到你合适的房子
the more likely it is to find a room that suits you.

39
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:04,460
挑好了呢还得查当天有没有房
After choosing, it still has to check room availability.

40
00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:06,600
确定价格和退订规则
Confirm the price and the cancellation rules.

41
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:09,440
你只要一点头他就会继续帮你
Once you agree, it will continue helping you.

42
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:14,020
推荐一家店跟订成这一单中间的事情
Between recommending a shop and completing that booking,

43
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:16,400
他一件都不会落下
it will not miss a single step.

44
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,960
对于开店的老板来说
For business owners,

45
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,280
就是这些变化就已经很直接了
these changes are already very direct.

46
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:24,840
以前你想让顾客多看你一眼
Before, to make customers notice you,

47
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,720
你要研究各个这个平台上的位置
You studied positions on various platforms,

48
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,920
视频和推荐
videos, and recommendations.

49
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:34,940
以后有些顾客可能只看到AI筛选出来的几家
Later, some customers may see only the few options AI selects.

50
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:37,160
如果根本没进这个名单
If you are not on that list at all,

51
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:41,140
就是你那个视频拍的再好这个顾客也未必看得到
however good your video is, that customer may never see it.

52
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:45,000
所以平台现在最先受到挑战的可能就是这一步
This may be the first challenge platforms face:

53
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,460
顾客还会不会打开慢慢的去挑了
will customers still open them and choose slowly?

54
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,800
但酒店的房态
But hotel room availability,

55
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:53,740
商家的商品订单和退款还得有人管
goods, orders, and refunds still need managing.

56
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:58,340
顾客不打开平台交易呢可能仍然会经过它
Even without opening the platform, a transaction may use it.

57
00:02:58,340 --> 00:03:02,660
平台呢不会轻易的把这些积累的东西让出去
Platforms will not easily give up what they have accumulated.

58
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:06,520
所以呢就是说平台原来的入口优势
So, the platform’s original entry-point advantage

59
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,740
可能会松动啊
may weaken.

60
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:11,460
但是商家的商品售后这些能力
But merchants, goods, and after-sales capabilities

61
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,700
仍然会参与到竞争
still take part in the competition.

62
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:15,780
9月21日
On September 21,

63
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:18,720
Meta的股价涨了约11%
Meta’s stock rose by about 11%.

64
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:23,140
扎克伯格呢也希望未来会从这个AI助理里面
Zuckerberg also hopes that, in the future, the AI assistant

65
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:26,140
促成交易之后收取它的费用
will collect fees after facilitating transactions.

66
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:30,420
目前呢国内啊也在往这个方向去做
Domestic companies are moving in this direction too.

67
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:32,700
但是只是走法可能有点不一样
But their approaches may be a little different.

68
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:35,920
最近呢咱们这个豆包的二代手机
Recently, the second-generation Doubao phone

69
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,340
就是把AI助理放进了手机系统
put the AI assistant into the phone’s operating system,

70
00:03:38,340 --> 00:03:41,300
让AI尝试跨应用办事
letting AI try to handle tasks across apps.

71
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,420
千问呢
Qwen, meanwhile,

72
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:45,700
则是把已经接上的这个阿里的服务
connects to Alibaba services already linked up.

73
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:50,240
你比如说像淘宝闪购飞猪高德这些全部接进来
For example, Taobao Instant Commerce, Fliggy, and Amap are all connected into it.

74
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:53,320
后来呢他又把这个淘宝互通了
Later, it also interconnected with Taobao,

75
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,580
连着商品订单物流和售后
linking goods, orders, logistics, and after-sales service.

76
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:58,380
豆包就是从手机里替你操作
Doubao operates for you from inside the phone.

77
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:01,360
另一家呢就是把自己已有的这个生意呢
The other brings its existing business

78
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,260
接进对话
into the conversation.

79
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:05,260
千问背后的这些商家商品交易服务
Behind Qwen are merchants, goods, and transaction services,

80
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,220
还有平台原有所有的东西拿出来
as well as everything the platform already has.

81
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:11,960
这个呢就是提醒我们本地企业做AI应用
This reminds us: local businesses implementing AI

82
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,460
不能光盯着模型会说什么
cannot focus only on what the model can say.

83
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:16,800
他能够查到哪些业务信息
What business information can it find?

84
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,460
能连接到哪项服务
Which service can it connect to?

85
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:22,220
遇到办不了的事由谁来接口这些都要看
When it cannot finish a task, who provides the interface? All of these need to be checked.

86
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:25,540
回到刚才兰州订房的这个客户
Back to that customer booking a room in Lanzhou.

87
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:28,860
假如你家的这个酒店有停车有电梯
Suppose your hotel has parking and a lift,

88
00:04:28,860 --> 00:04:31,680
也能晚入住啊本来就是很适合的
and allows late check-in; it would be a good fit.

89
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:34,340
可是网上你只写了环境好服务周到
But online, you only wrote “nice environment, attentive service.”

90
00:04:34,340 --> 00:04:35,960
那么这些条件没有写
These conditions were not written down.

91
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:38,300
AI助理就可能把你录取
The AI assistant may select you.

92
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:41,800
你开了这么多年店顾客常问什么
After years in business, what do customers often ask?

93
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,940
你其实最清楚
You know best.

94
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:45,120
就是免费停车还是收费
Is parking free, or is there a charge?

95
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,220
晚上几点以后需要提前联系
After what time should they contact you in advance?

96
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,480
什么情况下不能退
Under what conditions is a refund unavailable?

97
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:51,420
这些答案就是可能一直有你的前台
These answers may have been handled by your front desk,

98
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:52,660
一遍一遍的解释
explained over and over,

99
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:55,880
却没有整理到现在能够被查到的地方
but not organized somewhere searchable.

100
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,080
遇到这种情况呢
In that situation,

101
00:04:57,080 --> 00:05:00,380
我会先和老板们一起把现有的介绍
I first review the introduction with business owners.

102
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,100
和这些常见的问题先过一遍
and go over these common questions.

103
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:04,420
哪些没有写哪些已经过时了
What is missing, and what is already out of date?

104
00:05:04,420 --> 00:05:06,160
几个地方写的不一样的
What is inconsistent across different places?

105
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:10,440
以实际的能够提供的服务为准我们把它改清楚
We clarify it based on the services actually available.

106
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,920
我做的项目呢就是会从这些真实的信息入手
My projects start from this real information,

107
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:17,000
让AI能够查得到也尽量的理解准确
so AI can find it and understand it as accurately as possible.

108
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:20,320
至于他最后会不会推荐不能光靠我们自己说了算
Whether it recommends you is not for us alone to decide.

109
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:24,380
要实际的查到他怎么回答的依据是从哪里来的
We must check its answers and where the evidence comes from.

110
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:25,920
假设AI已经推荐了你
Suppose AI has already recommended you.

111
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:28,380
那顾客点进来却找不到
The customer clicks through but cannot find

112
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:30,680
这个预约的入口或者是电话打不通
the booking entry, or the phone does not connect.

113
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:33,540
这个时候呢你就是再多发一篇介绍
At that point, posting another introduction

114
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,400
也补不上这一步
will not fix this step.

115
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,420
所以我要和老板看的就是
What I want to check with owners is

116
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,560
在这条路上到底断在了哪里
where this route has actually broken.

117
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,640
哪些资料缺了
Which information is missing?

118
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:45,500
我们能不能把这些预约的页面打开
Can we get these booking pages to open?

119
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:50,380
就是当天还有没有房需要前台确认
Room availability requires front-desk confirmation.

120
00:05:50,380 --> 00:05:51,680
有人把这些接线
Someone makes these connections.

121
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:55,000
已有的平台我们就是能用的功能先用
Use the existing platform features that are available first.

122
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,620
不必说把这些所有的再另建一套
There is no need to build all of it again separately.

123
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:02,520
老板知道哪些条件能答应客户
Owners know which terms they can promise customers.

124
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:06,180
我先把这些资料和工具整理到员工能用的程度
I first organize the information and tools so staff can use them.

125
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:07,940
在一起我们检查结果
Then, together, we check the results.

126
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:11,200
咱们本地能够面对面的看这些业务
Here locally, we can review business face to face.

127
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,920
就把这些便利的条件咱们利用好
Let us use these convenient conditions.

128
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,780
你可以先拿店里的一项服务
Start with one service from your shop.

129
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:20,200
问AI,看他把地址服务条件说对了没有
Ask AI whether it got the address and service terms right.

130
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,680
给的联系方式和预约的方式能不能用
Can the contact and booking methods it gives actually work?

131
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:26,400
回答里面有出处的也点进去核对一下
If the answer cites a source, open it and check it too.

132
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:29,160
这样至少能看见就是顾客能够查到
At least you can see what customers can find,

133
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,300
你跟店里的实际情况到底差在哪里
and how you differ from the shop’s actual situation.

134
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:35,320
甘肃本地的老板想要做这个企业AI应用的
Gansu business owners wanting enterprise AI applications,

135
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:38,040
GEO的,可以带着你自己的这项服务
or GEO, can bring one of your own services,

136
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,600
我们一起来聊一聊
and we can talk it through together.

137
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:42,320
就咱们从顾客会问什么
Let us start with what customers will ask,

138
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:45,100
现在查到了什么,一起往下去看
and what they find now, and work through it.

139
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:46,260
我是超哥
I am Chao Ge,

140
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:49,300
在兰州做企业AI应用落地
implementing enterprise AI in Lanzhou.
